==Miscellaneous==
*Introduced [[Cat Units]]' fourth forms, named "[[Ultra Form]]s":
**Currently exclusive to [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]], which can attain their Ultra Forms at level 60 using [[Catfruit]] and Behemoth Stones.
**All [[Talents]] still apply.
*Added 4 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**16,001 raises [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|Superfeline]]'s level cap from 20+80 to 20+90.
**21,300 grants +5 Catamin [B].
**21,400 grants +5 Catamin [C].
**21,500 grants +10 Cat CPU.
*Raised [[Maneki Cat (Special Cat)|Maneki Cat]] and [[Coin Cat (Special Cat)|Coin Cat]]'s + level caps from +20 to +35.
*Raised [[Million-Dollar Cat (Special Cat)|Million-Dollar Cat]] and [[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Meditation Cat]]'s + level caps from +10 to +15.
*Added 1 new [[Special Abilities|Special Ability]]: [[Surge Attack#Counter-Surge|Counter-Surge]] for [[Cat Units]].
*Added 1 new item used in the [[Medal King's Palace (Event Gacha)|Medal King's Palace]] Gacha: Small Medal.

